**Student Services**

AEI prioritizes student services, which include counseling, tutoring, and career guidance. The partnership with organizations such as the National Association of Student Personnel Administrators (NASPA) ensures that best practices are followed. For instance, the Student Counseling Center at the University of Illinois at Chicago (UIC) provides mental health resources to over 5,000 students annually.

**Accreditation Processes**

Accreditation is critical for maintaining educational quality. AEI works closely with the Council for Higher Education Accreditation (CHEA) to facilitate the accreditation of institutions such as DePaul University and Loyola University Chicago. The accreditation process requires institutions to submit self-study reports every five years, ensuring adherence to academic standards.

